em_assets/steam/apps/3003050/ss_5b8ac2f2a7759de052228c82de09dd21ab5f8af3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749804135","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/ss_5b8ac2f2a7759de052228c82de09dd21ab5f8af3.600x338.jpg?t=1749804135"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/ss_bb359fda8bf329d5e8a7eaa0a208cf98d9469364.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749804135","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/ss_bb359fda8bf329d5e8a7eaa0a208cf98d9469364.600x338.jpg?t=1749804135"},{"id":12,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/ss_d02c9f93311c6c68e0bce146b012fbc7127ecb1f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749804135","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/ss_d02c9f93311c6c68e0bce146b012fbc7127ecb1f.600x338.jpg?t=1749804135"}],"short_description":"In a future where machines replaced all life, a small robot named Robert awakens. Manage an underground farm, grow strange crops, mine, fish, explore, and befriend robotic allies as you uncover the secrets of a forgotten world.","steam_appid":3003050,"support_info":{"email":"remrofsnart910@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}